  DisplayName: Cleaner Ram
  Description: 'Wrasse and Grouper only - a reef of Charge crystals in open water. The Wrasse loops its
    tail round Charge motes to power its ram; the Grouper flies a rival under the kite''s
    board, and a charged ram knocks their petals loose. Gather Charge crystals and more
    Charge motes come to the board. Every ram is a point. Higher intensities thin the
    crystals. First team to the target wins.'
